			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " the operator must open the comma group it sits in, so the rule is asked once\n\t\tper group rather than once per function ",
				"start": 351,
				"end": 475
			},
			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " …and the bounds: the adjuster must be the group's OWN function, a nameless\n\t\tgroup inside one is not it, and an authored glue stays glued ",
